Use logging scopes in a middleware so every log inside the request inherits the property.
```csharp
app.Use(async (ctx, next) => {
    var id = ctx.Request.Headers["X-Correlation-ID"].FirstOrDefault()
             ?? Guid.NewGuid().ToString();
    ctx.Response.Headers["X-Correlation-ID"] = id;
    var logger = ctx.RequestServices.GetRequiredService<ILogger<Program>>();
    using (logger.BeginScope(new Dictionary<string, object> { ["CorrelationId"] = id }))
        await next();
});
```
With OpenTelemetry, Activity.Current.TraceId is added automatically instead.

